<BaseLayout title="Plans & Upgrade — Nexauren Hub" description="Explore the current free Nexauren Hub tools and preview options that may be considered in the future." noindex={true}>
<main id="main-content" class="page-main"><div class="container"><nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Plans</span></nav><header class="page-hero compact-hero centered-hero"><span class="eyebrow">FAIR BY DESIGN</span><h1>Useful tools first.<br/><span class="gradient-text">More options later.</span></h1><p>The online tool library is free in this first release. Future paid features will be considered only if they add real value.</p></header><div class="plan-grid"><article class="plan-card"><span class="plan-label">AVAILABLE NOW</span><h2>Free</h2><p class="plan-description">Everything currently available to the public.</p><div class="plan-price">€0 <span>/ current tools</span></div><ul><li>✓ Published public tools</li><li>✓ Image, PDF, text and audio</li><li>✓ No account required</li><li>✓ Browser processing where supported</li><li>✓ No checkout</li></ul><a class="button button-secondary button-full" href="/tools/">Use free tools →</a></article><article class="plan-card plan-card-featured"><span class="plan-label plan-label-future">FUTURE POSSIBILITY</span><h2>Nexauren Plus</h2><p class="plan-description">A concept for optional advanced features — not available yet.</p><div class="plan-price">Not set <span>/ no billing now</span></div><ul><li>○ Potential advanced workflows</li><li>○ Potential batch processing</li><li>○ Potential productivity features</li><li>○ Designed around user feedback</li><li>○ No payments active</li></ul><button class="button button-primary button-full" type="button" disabled>Not available yet</button></article></div><p class="plan-disclaimer">This page is informational. No payment is collected, no subscription can be started and no paid feature is active. Any future plan will show pricing and separate terms before purchase.</p></div></main>
